     "text": "The Federal Aviation Administration (FAA) says the root cause is still unknown. Transportation Secretary Sean Duffy says it began while a contractor, L3Harris, moved old copper phone lines to fiber; L3Harris says it is helping the investigation. Officials say there is no sign of a cyberattack. Saturday cancellations passed 5,000.",
